      "value": "<p><strong>Trivial Mental Mutation</strong></p><p>You crave to consume something specific that\u2019s not socially acceptable, like blood, raw meat, filth, dung, rotten food, insects, books, leather or small living animals. Whatever it is, it doesn\u2019t make you sick. You\u2019ll need to suppress (see @UUID[Compendium.artantares-mutations.journal.JournalEntry.uDGFazW9Nr0N6ABS.JournalEntryPage.9sK84Dvy3Ng36qXp#self-control]{Self-Control}) the urge to not act on it at inopportune times. You can only gain this mutation once.</p>"
